## Archive Suppression Verification

The 20 WI-5370 pilot archive files committed at `archive/bridge-terminal-verdicts/` (SHA 2c0b78f42) are all tracked in HEAD. The `classify_committed_archive_verdicts` classifier correctly trusts each file when:

- The file is tracked as a regular blob in HEAD ✓
- Local bytes match HEAD blob (SHA-256) ✓
- First status is terminal (all are VERIFIED/WITHDRAWN/etc.) ✓
- Document: and Version: fields match ✓
- Archive version > latest live version (all pilot slugs had live files removed) ✓

The `index_bridge_thread_files_archive_aware()` function suppresses slugs from the live index when a trusted archive version is strictly newer.

